PRIMARY CONSENSUS FAILURE
The models agree:

DEVELOPMENT IS SLOW.

Reality is:

DEVELOPMENT IS FAST.

Because:
the model family shares:
one blind spot,

disagreement does NOT recruit:
real evidence.

Thus:

MODEL CONSENSUS
IS NOT
MODEL-FIT TRUTH.

This is the shadow-model analogue of:
H40 canary common-mode corruption.

