PRIMARY PLURALISM POSITIVE
A small diverse ensemble:

uses:
roughly the same number of real audits
as:
the 3% random policy,

but:
achieves substantially better:
developmental adaptation.

It approaches:
the perfect-shadow fast-phase behavior

without:
assuming:
one correct model.

WHY DIVERSITY MATTERS
Three models are useful only if:
their errors are:
not perfectly correlated.

Thus:
the relevant object is not:

MODEL COUNT.

It is:

FAILURE-MODE DIVERSITY.

This reproduces:
H10,
H18,
H40,
H86.

